## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Routing** | `http.ServeMux` with Go 1.22 patterns | No external deps; native `{id}` path params |
| **Concurrency** | `sync.RWMutex` on the user store | Safe for concurrent requests; read-heavy workload gets `RLock` |
| **Partial updates** | Pointer fields (`*string`) in update input | Distinguishes "not sent" from "sent as empty" |
| **Middleware** | Composable `http.Handler` wrappers | Easy to add auth, rate-limiting, etc. later |
| **Responses** | Uniform `APIResponse` envelope | Consistent shape for clients regardless of success/error |

> **Requires Go 1.22+** for the `mux.HandleFunc("GET /api/users/{id}", …)` pattern syntax. On older versions, replace with `r.URL.Path` parsing.

