|--------------------------|:------------:|:------:|
| `42` (number) | 42 | ✅ |
| `42.0` (number) | 42 | ✅ |
| `"0x2A"` (string) | 42 | ✅ |
| `"0o52"` (string) | 42 | ✅ |
| `"0b101010"` (string) | 42 | ✅ |
| `"0xA"` (string) | 10 | ✅ |
| `"11"` (string) | 11 | ✅ |
| `0` (number) | 0 | ✅ |
| `42.5` (number) | 42.5 | ❌ |
| `"0xFF"` (string) | 255 | ❌ |
| `"hello"` (string) | — | ❌ |

