## 1. `RecordingState.swift` — State Machine

```swift
import Foundation

/// Represents the lifecycle states of the recorder.
/// Using an enum enforces valid state transitions at compile time.
enum RecordingState: Equatable {
    case idle
    case recording
    case finished(URL)
    case failed(String)
}
