## What's Changed

**Left Pane — `ApiRequestPanel`** (replaces the old inline POST form):

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Method buttons** | A responsive grid of 12 API methods (FindPosition, DetectObjects, ClassifyImage, ReadText, CompareImages, GetImageInfo, CropImage, ResizeImage, DetectFaces, SegmentImage, GetBarcode, HealthCheck). Clicking one populates the URL and a sensible default JSON body. |
| **Request URL display** | Read-only monospace box showing the full `POST /api/{prefix}/{method}` URL. |
| **Editable request body** | A `<textarea>` pre-filled with the method's default JSON. The user can freely edit it and hit **Send Request** to re-fire the POST with the modified body. |
| **Editable response** | The response JSON lands in a second `<textarea>`. The user can tweak any field (e.g. change a confidence score, swap a label). |
| **Set as Mock** | A button that takes the *current* (possibly edited) response text, wraps it as `{ api: "<methodName>", response: <parsed json> }`, and POSTs it to `/api/{prefix}/setResponse`. Shows a ✓ / ✗ badge on success/failure. |
| **Status indicators** | A small colored dot + message next to the "Request" label shows HTTP status or error. A "Mock Set ✓" / "Mock Failed" badge appears next to the "Response" label. |

**Right Pane** — `GetImagePanel` and `SetMockResponsePanel` are kept (with minor cleanup) so you can still fetch a test image and configure the `getImage` mock independently.

All tabs share the same `VisionTabPage` layout; only `apiPrefix` differs, so every tab gets the full set of method buttons wired to its own `/api/visionN/...` endpoints.

# Ошибка CS0103: класс `Pathfinding` не существует

В вашем проекте нет класса `Pathfinding`. Нужно его создать. Вот полная реализация с алгоритмом A*:

## 1. `Pathfinding.cs`

```csharp
using UnityEngine;
using System.Collections.Generic;

public class Pathfinding : MonoBehaviour
{
    public static Pathfinding Instance;

    private Grid grid;

    private void Awake()
    {
        if (Instance == null)
        {
            Instance = this;
        }
        else
        {
            Destroy(gameObject);
            return;
        }

        grid = FindObjectOfType<Grid>();
    }

    public List<Node> FindPath(Vector3 startPos, Vector3 endPos)
    {
        if (grid == null) return null;

        Node startNode = grid.GetNodeFromWorldPosition(startPos);
        Node endNode   = grid.GetNodeFromWorldPosition(endPos);

        if (startNode == null || endNode == null) return null;

        // --- A* ---
        List<Node> openList = new List<Node>();
        List<Node> closedList = new List<Node>();

        openList.Add(startNode);
        startNode.gCost = 0;
        startNode.parent = null;

        while (openList.Count > 0)
        {
            Node current = openList[0];

            // Находим узел с минимальным fCost
            for (int i = 1; i < openList.Count; i++)
            {
                if (openList[i].fCost < current.fCost
                    || (openList[i].fCost == current.fCost && openList[i].hCost < current.hCost))
                {
                    current = openList[i];
                }
            }

            openList.Remove(current);
            closedList.Add(current);

            if (current == endNode)
                return ReconstructPath(startNode, endNode);

            foreach (Node neighbor in grid.GetNeighbors(current))
            {
                if (neighbor.isBlocked || closedList.Contains(neighbor))
                    continue;

                int moveCost = (current.row == neighbor.row || current.col == neighbor.col) ? 10 : 14;
                float tentativeG = current.gCost + moveCost;

                if (!openList.Contains(neighbor) || tentativeG < neighbor.gCost)
                {
                    neighbor.parent  = current;
                    neighbor.gCost   = tentativeG;
                    neighbor.hCost   = GetHeuristic(neighbor, endNode);
                    neighbor.fCost   = neighbor.gCost + neighbor.hCost;

                    if (!openList.Contains(neighbor))
                        openList.Add(neighbor);
                }
            }
        }

        return null; // Путь не найден
    }

    private int GetHeuristic(Node a, Node b)
    {
        int dx = Mathf.Abs(a.row - b.row);
        int dy = Mathf.Abs(a.col - b.col);
        return (dx + dy) * 10 + (dx < dy ? dx : dy) * 4; // октадная эвристика
    }

    private List<Node> ReconstructPath(Node start, Node end)
    {
        List<Node> path = new List<Node>();
        Node current = end;

        while (current != start)
        {
            path.Add(current);
            current = current.parent;
        }

        path.Reverse();
        return path;
    }
}
```

