# Refactored Playwright CRUD Test – SOLID + Design Patterns

## Architecture Overview

```
tests/
├── user.spec.ts              ← Spec layer (orchestration only)
api/
├── BaseAPI.ts                ← Abstraction (Dependency Inversion)
├── UserAPI.ts                ← Single Responsibility: user endpoints
├── PermissionAPI.ts          ← Single Responsibility: permission endpoints
pages/
├── LoginPage.ts              ← Page Object Model
factories/
├── UserFactory.ts            ← Factory Method: role-based user creation
