## 4. Expected API Contract

The backend endpoint `GET /api/rows?start=0&count=50` should return:

```json
{
  "rows": [
    { "id": 1, "name": "Alice", "email": "a@example.com", "created": "2025-01-10", "status": "active" },
    { "id": 2, "name": "Bob",   "email": "b@example.com", "created": "2025-01-11", "status": "inactive" }
  ],
  "total": 1234
}
```

| Param  | Meaning                              |
|--------|--------------------------------------|
| `start`| Zero-based offset into the full set  |
| `count`| Maximum number of rows to return     |

