## 9. Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **Single page** | All steps rendered in one HTML file; JS swaps field visibility |
| **Field highlighting** | CSS class `.active` with glow animation + border; `.completed` with green |
| **Only active field enabled** | All inputs get `disabled=true` except the current one; `pointer-events:none` on inactive groups |
| **Contextual help** | `helpPanel` updates per-field with `HelpText` + `TipText` from config |
| **Validation** | Two-layer: client-side (instant) + server-side (authoritative) |
| **State persistence** | Server-side `IMemoryCache` (swap for Redis in prod); `sessionToken` tracks progress |
| **Back navigation** | Preserved field values in `ProcessState.FieldValues`; re-populated on back |
| **Extensibility** | New processes = new `GuidedProcessConfig` object; zero UI code changes |

