# NovaPad — Advanced Notepad

A full-featured notepad in a single HTML file. Save it as `novapad.html` and open in any browser.

**Features:** syntax highlighting (JS, Python, CSS, HTML, JSON, Markdown), multi-tab editor, find & replace (regex/whole-word/case), auto-save to localStorage, auto-closing brackets, smart indent, bracket matching, line numbers, word wrap, dark/light themes, Markdown live preview, export/import/drag-drop files, print, zoom, zen mode, comment toggle, go-to-line, duplicate line, keyboard shortcuts, and a status bar.

